OL,4,CSouthport survivor backs knife sales   
OL,5,Clicence                                
OL,6,GA yoga instructor who survived the     
OL,7,GSouthport stabbing attack has said she 
OL,8,Gcannot "sit back" and "hope nothing    
OL,9,Glike this happens again", as she       
OL,10,Gbacked government plans to require     
OL,11,Gbusinesses to hold licences to sell    
OL,12,Gknives.                                
OL,14,FLeanne Lucas was critically injured    
OL,15,Fwhen she was stabbed as she helped to  
OL,16,Frun a Taylor Swift-themed dance class  
OL,17,Fon 29 July 2024.                       
OL,19,FThe attacker, who murdered three girls 
OL,20,Fand stabbed eight other children and   
OL,21,Ftwo adults, had bought the knife on    
OL,22,FAmazon.                           G2/4 
