OL,4,CNature walks 'another tool' in mental  
OL,5,Chealth fight                           
OL,6,GPeople struggling with their mental    
OL,7,Ghealth are being encouraged to connect 
OL,8,Gwith nature on their doorstep.         
OL,10,FHope Haven, in Whitehaven, west        
OL,11,FCumbria, opened in March as one of six 
OL,12,Fpilot centres across the country       
OL,13,Fdedicated to tackling problems before  
OL,14,Fthey escalate.                         
OL,16,FIt has now joined forces with the RSPB 
OL,17,Fto issue "nature prescriptions", which 
OL,18,Fsee people encouraged to visit a       
OL,19,Fnumber of places in the area, such as  
OL,20,Fthe local harbour, sand dunes at       
OL,21,FRavenglass and Walkmill Community      
OL,22,FWoodland at Moresby.              G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
