OL,4,CFan's surprise wedding proposal at     
OL,5,CMichael Jackson tribute show           
OL,6,GA Michael Jackson fan has described    
OL,7,Gthe "magical moment" she was proposed  
OL,8,Gto during a tribute show in front of   
OL,9,Gnearly 2,000 people.                   
OL,11,FUnder the guise of being a competition 
OL,12,Fwinner, Carol Bescoby was called on    
OL,13,Fstage with her partner, Paul McCarthy, 
OL,14,Fat the Winter Gardens Blackpool during 
OL,15,Fthe Michael Starring Ben show.         
OL,17,FBut Michael Jackson impersonator Ben   
OL,18,FBowman then handed the microphone to   
OL,19,FMcCarthy, who got down on one knee and 
OL,20,Fpopped the question.                   
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
